CodeSystem: CTDQuestionCategoriesFull
Id: ctd-categories-full
Title: "RTQ CTD Section Categories"
Description: "Common Technical Document (CTD) sections, following the ICH M4 granularity, used as category codes to tag regulatory questions with the dossier section they concern. Codes are the CTD section numbers (e.g., 3.2.P.8.1). Module 1 is regional and is represented by a single code; regulators use their own code systems for Module 1 sub-sections. This is a preferred, not a required, terminology: regulators may use their own category codes, and product domains that do not use the CTD use the terminology that fits them."
* ^url = "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/rtq/CodeSystem/ctd-categories-full"
* ^version = "0.2.0"
* ^status = #draft
* ^experimental = true
* ^date = "2026-10-26"
* ^jurisdiction = $m49.htm#001 "World"
* ^caseSensitive = true
* ^hierarchyMeaning = #is-a
* ^content = #complete
